-- DynSnow v1.3 for S.T.A.L.K.E.R. G.A.M.M.A. (dynsnow_gamma.script)
-- Inspired by Garry's Mod dynSnow | 100% Original Clean-Room Implementation | License: MIT
--
-- Features & Fixes in v1.3:
--   1. Seamless 42m Render Distance across BOTH High & Mid Terrain Shaders (80m x 80m 23-bit Torus!)
--   2. Bit-Exact 25-Slot Uniform Compensation (pre-subtracts 1.0 on C++ vaddss channels 2, 3 & 18
--      -> eliminates ALL position jumping, U-loop glitches, and disappearing trail segments!)
--   3. Immutable Placed Vertices + Stable Player/NPC Slot Partitioning (zero wobbling or slot-flipping!)
--   4. Multi-Ray Overhead Sky Check (tree branches & wires never cut gaps in snow trails!)
--   5. Smooth Per-Frame (dt) 3D Campfire Snow Melt & Subtle INVERNO-Style Weapon Frost
-- ==============================================================================================

